{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24899","headline":"题历山司徒右长史祖宅 · 湛贲","name":"题历山司徒右长史祖宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隳官长史籍，高步历山椒。\n丽句传黄绢，香名播宋朝。\n分能知止足，迹贵出尘嚣。\n松竹心长固，池台兴自饶。\n龙宫欣访旧，莺谷忝迁乔。\n从事叨承乏，铜章媿在腰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"湛贲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}